{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO THE PIONEER PROGRAM!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a future knocked off its axis by corporate greed and stupidity, you have been made redundant and abandoned on the far edge of space with little gear and no safety net. You must explore every nook and cranny, collect dozens of upgrades, and turn over every mysterious alien rock if you want to get revenge on your former employer and return to Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across multiple planets and through myriad challenges, you will be tasked with exploring and understanding these beautiful alien worlds. There are plants to scan, creatures to capture, lakes to swim, caves to spelunk, mountains to climb, upgrades to craft, and hundreds of secrets to uncover\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/extras/928257dec91c81e956b48c3d94019f44.avif?t=1766069600\" width=616 height=198 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC CO-OP </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with your best friend, partner or hellspawn on or between any platform! Or better still, experience the nostalgia tinged joy of sitting on the same couch and playing on the same screen with someone you love. Like the olden days when the world was young and we were happy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/extras/0b99118b7c32f49077d084dfb7e78f61.poster.avif?t=1766069600\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/extras/0b99118b7c32f49077d084dfb7e78f61.webm?t=1766069600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/extras/0b99118b7c32f49077d084dfb7e78f61.mp4?t=1766069600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXCITING FRESH ABILITIES AND TOOLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, Jump, Shoot, Grind, Stomp, Dodge, Slide, Whip and Grapple your way through the world! Experiment with 3 different types of gameplay goo! Lasso and Capture dozens of strange creatures and store them in Pens near your Habitat! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/extras/00e88e5a4c85eb9f9f4c1cca87d7292b.poster.avif?t=1766069600\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/extras/00e88e5a4c85eb9f9f4c1cca87d7292b.webm?t=1766069600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/extras/00e88e5a4c85eb9f9f4c1cca87d7292b.mp4?t=1766069600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOUR PLANETS TO EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four large, vibrant worlds to explore, each with their own weird and wonderful plants and creatures. Scan everything, catalog everything, and complete experiments to increase your science level\u2026 which unlocks exciting new gear! Plus\u2026 there may be more than four planets. Maybe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/extras/003a227ba6c19872b375cce898e429f4.poster.avif?t=1766069600\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/extras/003a227ba6c19872b375cce898e429f4.webm?t=1766069600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/extras/003a227ba6c19872b375cce898e429f4.mp4?t=1766069600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INTERGALACTIC HOARDER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alien plants! Bizarre creatures! Exciting gear! Weird rocks! Each planet is packed with nooks and crannies hiding all manner of rewards and secrets. Many of which can be displayed with pride in your own personal, customizable Space Trailer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/extras/1ba6ba7b625b0ac8de164acca3355737.poster.avif?t=1766069600\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/extras/1ba6ba7b625b0ac8de164acca3355737.webm?t=1766069600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/extras/1ba6ba7b625b0ac8de164acca3355737.mp4?t=1766069600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Zoologist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2787320/32a253bda087da4fb8b817a32b533c2a62fc1650.jpg"},{"name":"Character, Camera, Control","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2787320/74a364967dd13d14d12ffa3aa07d5f1fe92693c4.jpg"},{"name":"Cannonball","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2787320/17422f0618d578f84b604e194f1b6b0ebb4f6d70.jpg"},{"name":"Homeward Bound?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2787320/499c1830ee423f629c1da1e4ca96da4d80fa2f07.jpg"},{"name":"Gooooal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2787320/eda94c01a23a25b806a8596c67b6ad2f06938342.jpg"},{"name":"Side Notes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2787320/8a6d52d99878f37d111768eeca7ef78996bfc575.jpg"},{"name":"Alta Cares","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2787320/7e11e246b07c2ab4567ff91dbe15f8ad06e0c4a4.jpg"},{"name":"Clean it up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2787320/5a1c43c52ceedfdaf6da0be64c91451023f371e5.jpg"},{"name":"Homemaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2787320/067d2e680fd7500388277c0ec521bb30abe5ffb5.jpg"},{"name":"Crash Pad","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2787320/2dd7b864405f8ada2b916b3b47b1e683778c4587.jpg"}],"total":47},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2787320?t=1766069600","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766069600","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/9cdc2f3145c77e52c50f1d8471b5217695a15800/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766069600","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/9cdc2f3145c77e52c50f1d8471b5217695a15800/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766069600","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3874140,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>CRITICALLY ACCLAIMED</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/extras/60835126168c3d26e8d2c186f679ea23.avif?t=1766069600\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/extras_big/60835126168c3d26e8d2c186f679ea23.avif?t=1766069600 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p></p><br><h1>COSMIC HOARDER EDITION</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/extras/d83799aa2b603c00a15db3ec4aef6030.avif?t=1766069600\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/extras_big/d83799aa2b603c00a15db3ec4aef6030.avif?t=1766069600 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>COMPARISON GRID</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/extras/3e0d03ac64570e9fbfe701e3a03511c9.avif?t=1766069600\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/extras_big/3e0d03ac64570e9fbfe701e3a03511c9.avif?t=1766069600 width=800 height=450 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO THE PIONEER PROGRAM!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a future knocked off its axis by corporate greed and stupidity, you have been made redundant and abandoned on the far edge of space with little gear and no safety net. You must explore every nook and cranny, collect dozens of upgrades, and turn over every mysterious alien rock if you want to get revenge on your former employer and return to Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across multiple planets and through myriad challenges, you will be tasked with exploring and understanding these beautiful alien worlds. There are plants to scan, creatures to capture, lakes to swim, caves to spelunk, mountains to climb, upgrades to craft, and hundreds of secrets to uncover\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/extras/928257dec91c81e956b48c3d94019f44.avif?t=1766069600\" width=616 height=198 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC CO-OP </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with your best friend, partner or hellspawn on or between any platform! Or better still, experience the nostalgia tinged joy of sitting on the same couch and playing on the same screen with someone you love. Like the olden days when the world was young and we were happy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/extras/0b99118b7c32f49077d084dfb7e78f61.poster.avif?t=1766069600\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/extras/0b99118b7c32f49077d084dfb7e78f61.webm?t=1766069600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/extras/0b99118b7c32f49077d084dfb7e78f61.mp4?t=1766069600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXCITING FRESH ABILITIES AND TOOLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, Jump, Shoot, Grind, Stomp, Dodge, Slide, Whip and Grapple your way through the world! Experiment with 3 different types of gameplay goo! Lasso and Capture dozens of strange creatures and store them in Pens near your Habitat! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/extras/00e88e5a4c85eb9f9f4c1cca87d7292b.poster.avif?t=1766069600\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/extras/00e88e5a4c85eb9f9f4c1cca87d7292b.webm?t=1766069600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/extras/00e88e5a4c85eb9f9f4c1cca87d7292b.mp4?t=1766069600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOUR PLANETS TO EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four large, vibrant worlds to explore, each with their own weird and wonderful plants and creatures. Scan everything, catalog everything, and complete experiments to increase your science level\u2026 which unlocks exciting new gear! Plus\u2026 there may be more than four planets. Maybe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/extras/003a227ba6c19872b375cce898e429f4.poster.avif?t=1766069600\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/extras/003a227ba6c19872b375cce898e429f4.webm?t=1766069600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/extras/003a227ba6c19872b375cce898e429f4.mp4?t=1766069600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INTERGALACTIC HOARDER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alien plants! Bizarre creatures! Exciting gear! Weird rocks! Each planet is packed with nooks and crannies hiding all manner of rewards and secrets. Many of which can be displayed with pride in your own personal, customizable Space Trailer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/extras/1ba6ba7b625b0ac8de164acca3355737.poster.avif?t=1766069600\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787320/extras/1ba6ba7b625b0ac8de164acca3355737.webm?t=1766069600\" type=\"video/we